1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
(English Subtitle) Growing.Pains.S01E14 -= First.Blood =- Subripped by zerox

2
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:05,720
珍妮，不是说不想去.
Look, Jennifer, it's not that I don't want to go with you Saturday...

3
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:07,560
我还有别的事情呢
it's just that I've got this prior commitment.

4
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,620
我要捐献肾脏
I'm donating a kidney.

5
00:01:12,705 --> 00:01:15,121
不过别告诉任何人
Look, but don't tell anybody.

6
00:01:15,575 --> 00:01:18,798
不然大家抢着要
Well, 'cause then everybody'll want one.

7
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:20,780
若是捐不成我在通知你
Look, if the deal falls through, I'll let you know.

8
00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:22,840
好吧，再见
Okay, all right, bye-bye.

9
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:26,300
你拒绝了跟珍妮约会？
You turned down a date with Jennifer Miller?

10
00:01:27,187 --> 00:01:30,273
“大波波”珍妮？
Jennifer "Wonder Buns" Miller?

11
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:34,600
我看女人并不注重外表
Hey, my attraction to women is not entirely based on physical beauty.

12
00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:36,840
对，她们还得愚蠢
Yeah, they gotta be stupid, too.

13
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:40,060
麦克，你不是很喜欢珍妮的吗？
Mike, I thought you liked Jennifer.

14
00:01:40,580 --> 00:01:43,680
是的，但是她要我做一些 一万年也不会做的事
Yeah, but she wants me to do something I'd never do in a million years.

15
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,080
什么？看书？
What? Read a book?

16
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:49,340
不，更糟糕，她让我参加姐姐的婚礼
No, worse, she wants me to go to her sister's wedding...

17
00:01:49,340 --> 00:01:51,600
还要跳舞
and go ballroom dancing.

18
00:01:52,312 --> 00:01:56,230
老天爷真是瞎了 怎么能如此对孩子们
As God is our witness, they can't make our baby do this.

19
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:59,419
你们尽管取笑.
Okay, fine, fine. You guys go ahead and laugh...

20
00:01:59,419 --> 00:02:03,280
我麦克.西弗绝对不想 在200人面前出洋相
but Michael Seaver is not gonna make a fool of himself in front of 200 people.

21
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:05,460
你的洋相已经不少了
Yeah, you're used to a much bigger crowd.

22
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:09,240
麦克，跳舞也有好处.
Mike, there are advantages to ballroom dancing.

23
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:11,240
可以亲密接触你的舞伴
You know, you actually get to touch your partner...

24
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:14,360
手牵手，脸贴脸
hand to hand, cheek to cheek...

25
00:02:15,340 --> 00:02:17,060
还有什么什么贴着什么什么
everything else to everything else.

26
00:02:17,237 --> 00:02:18,960
杰森!
Oh, Jason!

27
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:23,780
如果你有魅力，如果你懂诀窍.
And if you're a real cool guy, and you learn all the moves, Mike...

28
00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:26,320
使用魅力和诀窍.
well, the right guy and the right moves...

29
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:29,080
绝对能让女人.
can absolutely make the right woman...

30
00:02:30,049 --> 00:02:31,431
融化
melt.

31
00:02:31,940 --> 00:02:34,660
还有些诀窍要在房间里施展
There are more moves, but they require a motel room.

32
00:02:35,940 --> 00:02:41,420
不，注意观察
Not so. Observe.

33
00:02:41,420 --> 00:02:42,700
法国式
The French dip.

34
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:46,520
还有些诀窍，但是要好吃的东西
There are more moves, but they require gravy.

35
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:54,840
珍妮，是我，捐不成了
Yeah, Jennifer, Mike. Look, the deal fell through.

36
00:02:56,220 --> 00:02:58,680
不知道，看来肾脏已经供过于求了
I don't know. Apparently, there's a real glut on the world kidney market.

37
00:02:59,779 --> 00:03:02,420
是的，我们去参加婚礼
Yeah, so we're on for the wedding.

38
00:03:02,420 --> 00:03:03,540
是的，我会带好吃的来
Yeah, and I'll bring the gravy.

39
00:03:04,440 --> 00:03:05,240
先别管，那是舞蹈术语
Never mind, it's a dancing term.

40
00:03:06,380 --> 00:03:07,800
好的，再见
Yeah, okay, bye-bye.

41
00:03:08,940 --> 00:03:09,980
好极了
All right, Mike.

42
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:12,300
对，我一定要让她融化
All right, Dad. You know, I'm gonna make her melt.

43
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:15,040
我还没见过融化了的“大波波”呢
I have never seen "Wonder Buns" melt before.

44
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:21,760
且慢，我还不会跳舞呢
Wait a minute. I don't even know how to dance.

45
00:03:22,540 --> 00:03:24,900
没关系，过来试试看
That's all right, no problem. Come on over here and give it a try.

46
00:03:27,780 --> 00:03:29,480
不是我，跟你妈妈试
Not with me, with your mother.

47
00:03:31,580 --> 00:03:33,060
你需要.
What you try to do is you try to...

48
00:03:33,112 --> 00:03:35,615
-滑步，2，3 -滑步
- glide, two, three. - Glide.

49
00:03:35,615 --> 00:03:37,339
滑步
Glide.

50
00:03:38,540 --> 00:03:39,980
够了!我受够了
That's it! I've had it.

51
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:42,433
是可忍，孰不可忍!
A man can only take so much.

52
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,580
出问题了？
Something wrong, Ben?

53
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:47,520
教练的傻儿子罗尼
The new coach and his stupid son, Rodney.

54
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:50,860
他今天三次用球棍把我绊倒
The kid tripped me three times today with his stick.

55
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:54,180
下次要给他一点眼色瞧瞧
Next practice, that kid is gonna be sucking the puck.

56
00:03:55,540 --> 00:03:57,460
本，不要说这种话
Now, I don't want to hear that, Ben.

57
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:59,220
和队员之间有矛盾.
If you have a problem with one of your teammates...

58
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,900
大家是不能解决问题的
fighting is not the answer.

59
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,940
本，你在干什么？
Ben, what are you doing?

60
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,100
锻炼
Pumping milk.

61
00:04:04,677 --> 00:04:06,620
施瓦辛格也是这么过来的
Hey, it worked for Schwarzenegger.

62
00:04:06,620 --> 00:04:06,937
And one. And two. And three.

63
00:04:06,937 --> 00:04:08,460
1，2，3

64
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:12,080
等等，教练的儿子绊倒你了？
Now wait a minute. Did you try telling the coach that Rodney tripped you?

65
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:14,100
教练全都看见了
The coach saw the whole thing.

66
00:04:14,660 --> 00:04:16,280
你是说.
Now come on. You mean to tell me...

67
00:04:16,556 --> 00:04:18,820
教练教唆罗尼来阴的？
that the coach actually told Rodney to play dirty?

68
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:22,200
他让所有队员都来阴的 他讨厌我
He tells all the kids to play dirty. That's why he hates me.

69
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:26,340
因为众所周知，我是队里的尖子
It's common knowledge, I'm a finesse player.

70
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,760
本，够了
Well, that's it, Ben.

71
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:32,960
我一直认为冰球太暴力了
I was afraid this hockey thing was going to be too rough.

72
00:04:33,340 --> 00:04:34,880
杰森，这次就离开球队吧
Jason, I think he should quit the team.

73
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:37,240
不，麦姬 因为兴教练不和而离开球队.
No, Maggie, that's not fair to Ben.

74
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:39,640
这对本来说不公平
Just because the coach is out of line, you can't make him quit.

75
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:41,320
下次练习.
I'll go down to the next practice...

76
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:43,200
我去找教练谈谈
I'll meet the guy, and we'll talk it all over...

77
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:45,000
你说好不好
if that's okay with you, Ben.

78
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,300
好的，谢谢爸爸
Yeah, thanks, Dad.

79
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:48,220
你分散教练的注意力.
And while you keep the coach busy talking...

80
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:50,140
我趁机去踩罗尼的脸
I'll go and skate over Rodney's face.

81
00:04:57,660 --> 00:05:01,300
小女孩们，这是冰球，不是跳舞
Come on, girls, this is hockey, not a square dance.

82
00:05:01,540 --> 00:05:03,400
要大胆地身体接触
I want to see some contact out there.

83
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:07,300
记住，穿上冰鞋不等于禁止踢人
Remember, just 'cause you're wearing skates doesn't mean you can't kick.

84
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:08,640
懂吗？
All right?

85
00:05:09,940 --> 00:05:11,660
你好，我叫杰森.西弗
Hello. Hi, I'm Jason Seaver.

86
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:13,040
我是布克顿教练，你好
Coach Brockton. How are you?

87
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:14,980
那边7号是我儿子本
That's my boy, Ben, out there, number seven.

88
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,760
他应该增加40磅
Yeah, he could use another 40 pounds.

89
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:20,140
没问题，我给他打激素吧
Well, no problem. I'll get him started on steroids right away.

90
00:05:20,260 --> 00:05:22,900
很好，家长肯合作就最好了
Good, I like to see the parents get involved.

91
00:05:26,893 --> 00:05:28,027
凯里!
Kelly!

92
00:05:28,027 --> 00:05:31,160
凯里，要懂得传球，不然要!
Kelly, you should've passed off. That's gonna cost you.

93
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:34,320
对，罚他们留下来跑圈就对了
Sure, make him skate a few extra laps after practice, huh?

94
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:37,080
教练，有5块散钱吗？
Do you have change for $5, Coach?

95
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:39,480
还找钱？
What are you talking about, change?

96
00:05:39,500 --> 00:05:42,300
球没交给无人防守的队员 这要罚款5块，去跑一圈
You missed the open man. That is $5. Take a lap.

97
00:05:46,546 --> 00:05:48,340
你对孩子们罚款了？
You're fining these kids?

98
00:05:48,340 --> 00:05:50,500
他不是初犯了
Hey, that is not a first-time offender.

99
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:54,000
要是有死刑那多好
Too bad they outlawed the death penalty.

100
00:05:55,521 --> 00:05:56,771
是啊
Yeah.

101
00:05:58,858 --> 00:06:01,180
开米罗，你这叫防守？
Carmello, you call that a check?

102
00:06:01,180 --> 00:06:02,720
我老婆在蜜月时打我都比你狠
My wife hit harder on our honeymoon.

103
00:06:03,730 --> 00:06:06,185
你老婆是葛瑞兹基吗？ [著名冰球运动员]
Who'd you marry, Wayne Gretzky?

104
00:06:06,220 --> 00:06:07,780
你敢说我是同性恋？
You calling me a homosexual?

105
00:06:08,935 --> 00:06:11,840
不，我是说你的执教方法太激进了
No, but I do think your coaching methods are a little offensive.

106
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:13,840
我的队伍所向无敌
Hey, I never had a losing season, buddy.

107
00:06:14,380 --> 00:06:16,060
那恭喜你了
Well, congratulations, buddy...

108
00:06:16,540 --> 00:06:19,080
但孩子们需要在娱乐中.
but I think what's important for these kids is they learn something...

109
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:20,140
学到东西
they have a little fun.

110
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:22,700
而不是为了胜利不顾一切
Not win, win, win, at all costs.

111
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:25,220
越战就是这么输的
That's how we lost Vietnam.

112
00:06:26,185 --> 00:06:27,420
西弗，你是个孬种
You're a wimp, Seaver.

113
00:06:27,420 --> 00:06:29,760
是吗，那你呢？
Oh, really? Well, you know what you are?

114
00:06:30,022 --> 00:06:30,600
什么？
Yeah?

115
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:34,660
你把孩子们当作出气袋
You're taking a lot of sublimated anger and you're displacing it on these kids.

116
00:06:35,580 --> 00:06:38,180
你他妈的就像心理医生
You sound like you've been to one of them wussy shrinks.

117
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:41,240
我就是他妈的心理医生
I am one of them wussy shrinks.

118
00:06:42,380 --> 00:06:43,940
我是个精神病医师
I mean, I'm a psychiatrist.

119
00:06:44,420 --> 00:06:46,880
只是你心胸狭隘，自以为是.
Just because you're a little self-absorbed and narrow-minded...

120
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:49,300
谁自以为是了？
Hey, who are you calling self-absorbent?

121
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:51,200
你最好收回你的话!
You better be ready to back that up, pal!

122
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:52,820
别动手动脚的
Keep your hands off me. Okay?

123
00:06:52,912 --> 00:06:53,440
爸爸，教训他
Hit him, Dad.

124
00:06:53,440 --> 00:06:54,960
-本，成年人.. -成你的头
- Ben, that's not the way mature people... - Mature nothing.

125
00:07:01,521 --> 00:07:03,322
-滑步，2，3，好 -滑步，2，3
- Glide, two, three. Right. - Glide, two, three.

126
00:07:03,322 --> 00:07:06,837
-滑步，2，3，滑步，2，3 -滑步，2，3，滑步，2，3
- Glide, two, three. Glide, two, three. - Glide, two, three. Glide, two, three.

127
00:07:07,340 --> 00:07:10,120
麦克，半小时内第5次踩到了
Mike, that's the fifth time in the last half hour.

128
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,400
我进步不少了
Hey, I'm getting better.

129
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:15,140
很好，今晚到此为止
Good, then let's call it a night.

130
00:07:15,140 --> 00:07:16,440
我还要写文章
I've got an article to finish.

131
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:19,800
妈妈，明晚就要举行婚礼了 我需要练习
Come on, Mom. The wedding's tomorrow night. I need to practice.

132
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,320
亲爱的，你跳得很好了
Honey, you're doing fine.

133
00:07:21,640 --> 00:07:23,580
而且，我还要换脚上的绷带
Besides, I've gotta change the bandages on my feet.

134
00:07:25,140 --> 00:07:27,340
拜托，连皮都没有破
Come on, I barely broke the skin.

135
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:37,880
我常常在想.
You know, I often wonder, what's more beautiful?

136
00:07:38,420 --> 00:07:40,600
是繁星夜空漂亮.
The glimmering stars on a clear night...

137
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:43,080
还是这张脸漂亮？
or this face?

138
00:07:44,063 --> 00:07:46,200
算了吧，我不会和你跳舞的
Forget it. I'm not dancing with you.

139
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:48,480
跳吧，凯罗，我不会踩你
Come on, Carol. I'm not gonna step on your feet.

140
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:50,160
你把妈的脚都踩扁了
You stepped all over Mom's.

141
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:53,740
凯罗，妈妈的脚实在太大了
Carol, the woman has huge feet...

142
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:58,640
咱私下说好了，妈妈不懂跳舞
and just between you and me, Mom can't dance.

143
00:07:59,140 --> 00:08:00,420
你真是个饭桶
You're such a jerk.

144
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,700
说得对
You're right. I am.

145
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,800
我真的是个饭桶
No, no, really, I am...

146
00:08:07,453 --> 00:08:09,840
所以上天才眷顾我
and that's why I'm so incredibly fortunate...

147
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:13,840
给了我一位姐姐
to have a sister who's not just a sister...

148
00:08:13,860 --> 00:08:16,000
她是一位仙女
but, well, a saint.

149
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:18,880
所以我应该叫你.
That's why I think I'll call you...

150
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:23,460
仙女姐姐
Saint Sister Carol, no Sister Saint Carol.

151
00:08:23,660 --> 00:08:27,820
或者说仙女凯罗，你真的.
No, I got it, Carol Saint Sister, because, after all, Carol, you are...

152
00:08:27,865 --> 00:08:30,900
好了，好了，我宁愿、断脚也不听这些
All right, all right. I'd rather lose a foot than listen to this.

153
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,180
好了吗？
Okay, ready?

154
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:04,240
滑步，2，3
And glide, two, three.

155
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:04,340
滑步，2，3，滑步，2，3
Glide, two, three. Glide, two, three...

156
00:09:04,340 --> 00:09:04,440
真好玩
Hey, this is sort of neat.

157
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:04,540
凯罗，干嘛？
Whoa, Carol, what are you doing?

158
00:09:04,540 --> 00:09:04,640
跳舞
Dancing.

159
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:04,740
这不是自由舞蹈，这是舞会
Carol, this is not interpretive dancing. This is ballroom dancing.

160
00:09:04,740 --> 00:09:04,840
男人负责带领.
The man is supposed to lead.

161
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:04,940
女人不动就行了
The woman is supposed to be limp, okay?

162
00:09:04,940 --> 00:09:05,040
息随尊便
Whatever you say.

163
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:05,140
好吧，再来，滑步，2，3，滑步.
Okay, try it again. And glide, two, three. Glide...

164
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:07,440
拜托，也不用像死人一样
Come on, Carol, this isn't limp. It's dead.

165
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,040
跟上就行了
Just following your lead.

166
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:14,800
再来，滑步，2，3，滑步
Okay, let's try it again. Glide, two, three. Glide...

167
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:16,380
麦克，大有进步了
Hey, Mike, you're doing better.

168
00:09:17,314 --> 00:09:19,119
滑步，2，3.
Glide, two, three...

169
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:22,700
凯罗，今天到此为止吧
Well, I think that'll be it for today, Carol.

170
00:09:28,260 --> 00:09:29,660
本，怎样了？
Ben, how did it go?

171
00:09:29,820 --> 00:09:31,480
真是太难以相信了
It was unbelievable!

172
00:09:33,060 --> 00:09:34,180
亲爱的，我回家了
Hi, honey. I'm home.

173
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:36,340
杰森，怎么了？
Jason, what happened?

174
00:09:36,340 --> 00:09:39,340
可以说我和布克顿教练.
Well, I guess you could say Coach Brockton and I had...

175
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:42,340
进行了一次有意义的思想交流
a brief, but meaningful, exchange of ideas.

176
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:45,180
还有拳头交流，爸爸打得痛快
And fists! Dad whooped him good!

177
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:46,820
爸爸，好样的
All right, Dad.

178
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:49,800
杰森，你跟教练打起来了？
Jason, you mean you actually got in a fight with the coach?

179
00:09:49,940 --> 00:09:51,780
麦姬，是他打我
Well, he took a swing at me, Maggie.

180
00:09:51,780 --> 00:09:53,120
我只是自卫
I had to defend myself.

181
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:55,600
我去弄点冰块给你敷眼睛
Well, I better get some ice for that eye.

182
00:09:56,320 --> 00:10:00,500
麦克，你看这场面，拳来拳往
Mike, you should have seen it. Pow! Bang! Boom!

183
00:10:00,740 --> 00:10:02,880
布克顿连还手的机会都没有!
Brockton never had a chance!

184
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:07,800
欢迎来到擂台旁边“猛兽西弗”这里.
And we're here at ringside with Jason "the Animal" Seaver...

185
00:10:08,260 --> 00:10:11,780
还有他的经纪人.
and along with us at ringside is the Animal's manager...

186
00:10:12,002 --> 00:10:13,806
“禽兽”西弗
Benjamin "Bugsy" Seaver.

187
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:17,840
“禽兽” 今天是如何让拳王热血沸腾的？
Tell us, Bugsy, how did you get the champ's blood boiling for today's bout?

188
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:20,280
我把哥哥的成绩单让他看了
I showed him his oldest son's report card.

189
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:23,780
“猛兽”，下一个目标是？
Well, Animal, what's next?

190
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:25,140
我要击倒霍姆斯.
Well, I want Holmes...

191
00:10:25,340 --> 00:10:27,400
接着是诺顿，接着是克雷顿
and then I want Norton, and then I want Kramden.

192
00:10:27,660 --> 00:10:31,920
接着退隐山林，成为全职心理医生
And then I'm going to retire to pursue psychiatry, full-time.

193
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:36,080
你这样会让孩子们认为打架是好事
Jason, you're going to make the kids think fighting is a good thing.

194
00:10:37,100 --> 00:10:39,340
说得对，我跟他们说说
You're right. I'll talk to them.

195
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:43,340
孩子们，我今天的所作所为当受责备
Boys, what I did today was reprehensible.

196
00:10:44,260 --> 00:10:46,820
暴力不是解决问题的方法
Fighting is not the best way to solve your problems.

197
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,780
这点要说清楚
I want that to be clear.

198
00:10:49,940 --> 00:10:50,680
谢谢
Thank you.

199
00:10:59,900 --> 00:11:03,540
麦姬，我不想再为昨天的事.
Maggie, I just don't think I should have to spend another...

200
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:07,800
花时间去找借口了
24 hours making excuses for what happened yesterday.

201
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:10,480
因为根本找不到借口
You can't, because there is no excuse.

202
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:14,660
就像野蛮人一样打架 事后像孩子一样得意
You fought like a barbarian, and then you gloated like a child.

203
00:11:15,420 --> 00:11:17,400
你是个野蛮的孩子
You're a baby-barbarian.

204
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:20,380
就这么一次意外.
I see, so you're saying by that one incident...

205
00:11:20,380 --> 00:11:22,760
难道就让孩子变成兰波不成？
I'm turning our son into another Rambo.

206
00:11:23,573 --> 00:11:25,512
我回家了
Hi, honey. I'm home.

207
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:27,980
天哪
Oh, my God.

208
00:11:33,940 --> 00:11:37,120
坐下来，发生什么事了？
Come on, Ben. Sit down. Tell us exactly what happened.

209
00:11:38,160 --> 00:11:40,400
我当时在饭堂.
Right. I was sitting in the cafeteria...

210
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:43,540
正在吃牛排，还有土豆.
eating my Salisbury steak, mashed potatoes...

211
00:11:43,660 --> 00:11:47,500
还有一种椰菜还是草皮什么的
and something that looked like either broccoli or AstroTurf.

212
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:50,000
本，打架的事
Ben, the fight.

213
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:54,500
接着罗尼.布克顿走过来.
Yeah, that's when Rodney Brockton walked over...

214
00:11:54,500 --> 00:11:55,980
把我揪了起来
and pulled me out of my chair.

215
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,720
罗尼.布克顿
Rodney Brockton.

216
00:11:58,708 --> 00:12:02,911
对，我就说“罗尼..”
Yeah. I said, "Rodney, I don't know what makes me sicker...

217
00:12:03,020 --> 00:12:04,720
“你比这顿饭更恶心”
"you or this lunch."

218
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:08,940
然后我就像“猛兽”杰森一样
Then I did what Jason "the Animal" Seaver would have done.

219
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:11,580
给他一记拳头
I gave him a knuckle sandwich.

220
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:15,340
“猛兽”，这下快乐了吗？
Well, Animal, are you proud of yourself?

221
00:12:16,560 --> 00:12:18,280
我并没有快乐
No, Maggie. I'm not proud.

222
00:12:19,830 --> 00:12:22,768
本，罗尼没事吧？
Ben, is Rodney okay?

223
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:26,100
没事，芬克小姐拉开我们了
Yeah, Miss Finkle came and broke it up...

224
00:12:26,100 --> 00:12:29,640
但是明天中午我们要决斗
but tomorrow at high noon, we meet under the monkey bars...

225
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:32,760
只有一个人能活下来读4年级
and only one of us makes it to the fourth grade.

226
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:35,980
太过分了
Well, I've had enough of this.

227
00:12:36,180 --> 00:12:38,020
我要亲自和布克顿谈谈
I'm going down to talk to Brockton myself.

228
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:40,540
麦姬，事情因我而起
No. No, Maggie. I started this whole thing...

229
00:12:41,685 --> 00:12:46,261
我要让本看看真正的男人 是如何斗争的
so I guess it's time that I showed Ben how a real man fights his battles.

230
00:12:46,623 --> 00:12:48,595
好极了，爸爸!
All right, Dad!

231
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,240
来吧
Come on, Ben.

232
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:57,080
假定你们在角落，裁判没看到
Now let's say you're mixing it up in the corner. The ref isn't looking.

233
00:12:57,900 --> 00:12:59,220
你们会怎样？
What do you do?

234
00:13:01,400 --> 00:13:03,780
-罗尼，示范 -好的，爸爸
- Rodney, demonstrate. - Okay, Dad.

235
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:13,880
好极了，比赛时，记得再补上一拳
Perfect. Now in a game, you make sure you follow that up with a punch.

236
00:13:16,380 --> 00:13:18,920
教练，这是犯法的
Excuse me, Coach, but isn't this illegal?

237
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:23,026
这是冰球场，要合法就去法庭
This is hockey, kid. You want legal, go to law school.

238
00:13:23,026 --> 00:13:25,098
-去跑一圈 -是，教练
- Take a lap. - Yes, sir.

239
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:27,980
谁来动手？
Okay, so who makes the first move?

240
00:13:28,100 --> 00:13:29,740
我来，你跟着我
I do, you just follow my lead.

241
00:13:29,766 --> 00:13:31,269
好的
Gotcha.

242
00:13:31,380 --> 00:13:32,840
爸爸，看谁来了
Dad, look who's here.

243
00:13:33,620 --> 00:13:36,380
西弗，有何贵干？ 你儿子被球队开除了
What are you doing here, Seaver? Your kid was cut from the team.

244
00:13:37,140 --> 00:13:38,860
教练，我要跟你谈谈
Well, Coach, I'd like to talk to you.

245
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:41,200
当天说了些侮辱你的话
I know I said some pretty insulting things the other day...

246
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,740
今天我还有一些话要说
and, today, there's something else I'd like to say.

247
00:13:43,500 --> 00:13:45,900
我建议说“你去死吧，胆小鬼!”
Might I suggest, "Drop dead, chicken lips"?

248
00:13:46,316 --> 00:13:48,855
本，让我来
Ben, let me handle this.

249
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:53,400
布克顿先生，对不起 我是来道歉的
Mr. Brockton, I'm sorry. I came to apologize.

250
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:56,060
没门，你应该报复
No way, Seaver. I owe you one.

251
00:13:56,420 --> 00:13:57,000
来吧
Come on.

252
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,700
我不是来打架的
Look, I didn't come here to fight.

253
00:14:00,160 --> 00:14:02,640
我不是故意要冒犯你的
I didn't mean to say or do anything to offend you.

254
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:06,020
你说我老婆是“葛瑞兹基”!
You said I was married to Wayne Gretzky!

255
00:14:06,060 --> 00:14:07,260
这口气我咽不下去
Now I'm not gonna take that, Seaver.

256
00:14:07,304 --> 00:14:12,345
我不是真的说你老婆是“葛瑞兹基”
Look, I didn't mean to say, seriously, that you were married to Wayne Gretzky.

257
00:14:12,500 --> 00:14:14,440
你说我们是罪人？
So you're saying we lived in sin?

258
00:14:14,580 --> 00:14:17,840
我没有含沙射影什么.
I didn't mean to imply that you had any relationship whatsoever...

259
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:21,440
这么说“葛瑞兹基”也轮不到我娶了吗？
I get it. So now Wayne is too good for me, huh?

260
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:24,220
我不是说..若你非得如此.
No, I'm not talking... Look, if you're just...

261
00:14:24,760 --> 00:14:26,120
找借口打架.
If you just want another excuse to fight...

262
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:28,520
我打架不需要找借口，来吧
I don't need any excuses. Come on.

263
00:14:29,060 --> 00:14:31,300
你爸爸怎么不卷起袖子？
How come your dad isn't rolling up his sleeves?

264
00:14:31,420 --> 00:14:35,100
他要是发力，亲衣会被震碎
Once he starts flexing those muscles, his shirt pops off by itself.

265
00:14:36,166 --> 00:14:37,907
咱再打一场
It's rematch time, Seaver.

266
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:39,960
你要我先动手吗？不客气了
Now you want me to start it, I'll start it.

267
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:43,100
好吧，要打就打吧 我不是担心我自己
Okay, you want to hit me, go ahead. Fine, hit me. I'm not worried about me.

268
00:14:43,300 --> 00:14:45,140
也没有害怕你，我是担心这些孩子
I'm not worried about you. It's these kids.

269
00:14:45,860 --> 00:14:50,060
要是让孩子们以为暴力能解决问题.
If we can't teach our children that fighting is not the answer, then we have failed...

270
00:14:50,060 --> 00:14:52,580
那我们就愧为父母了
as parents and as human beings.

271
00:14:53,016 --> 00:14:56,759
你可以打我，也可以讲和
So you can hit me, or you can shake my hand.

272
00:14:58,140 --> 00:14:59,060
你自己选吧
Choice is yours.

273
00:15:05,729 --> 00:15:07,400
西弗.
Seaver...

274
00:15:09,899 --> 00:15:12,038
爸爸，教训他!
Now, belt him, Dad!

275
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:15,500
来吧，孬种，让孩子们见识一下
Yeah, that's right, wuss. Come on, show the kid what you're really made out of.

276
00:15:20,060 --> 00:15:21,540
本，咱回家吧
Come on, Ben. We're going home.

277
00:15:22,912 --> 00:15:24,414
什么？
What?

278
00:15:35,025 --> 00:15:36,493
麦克，抓紧一点.
Hey, Mike, you better get a move on.

279
00:15:36,493 --> 00:15:38,595
珍妮10分钟后就到了
Jennifer's going to be here in 10 minutes.

280
00:15:38,595 --> 00:15:41,431
天哪，忘记淋浴了
Oh, my God. I still have to shower...

281
00:15:41,431 --> 00:15:43,398
还要刮胡子
and shave.

282
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:46,443
一个月刮一次就行了
Gee, it's another month already?

283
00:15:47,837 --> 00:15:53,047
滑步，2，3，滑步，2，3.
And glide, two, three. Glide, two, three. Glide, two, three. Glide, two, three.

284
00:15:54,944 --> 00:15:57,446
天哪，我长豆豆了
Oh, my God. I've got a zit.

285
00:16:00,016 --> 00:16:01,983
真是苍天有眼
There is a God.

286
00:16:04,921 --> 00:16:06,022
本，你好
Hi, Ben.

287
00:16:06,022 --> 00:16:07,989
我要喝酒
I need a drink.

288
00:16:10,093 --> 00:16:12,262
杰森，怎么了？
Jason, what happened?

289
00:16:12,262 --> 00:16:14,431
布克顿说我是孬种
Well, Coach Brockton called me a wimp...

290
00:16:14,431 --> 00:16:17,967
然后朝我肚子狠狠一拳
and then he punched me as hard as he could in the stomach.

291
00:16:17,967 --> 00:16:20,844
但下面要面对的才是最糟糕的
Now comes the rough part of the evening.

292
00:16:28,078 --> 00:16:31,318
本，喝牛奶解决不了问题
Ben, Ben, milk is not the answer.

293
00:16:32,282 --> 00:16:34,551
没想到你今天这么窝囊
I can't believe you chickened out today.

294
00:16:34,551 --> 00:16:38,154
住嘴，孩子说这话要打屁股的
Now hold on right there. A lot of kids would get spanked for that.

295
00:16:38,154 --> 00:16:40,056
打我吧
Sure, hit me.

296
00:16:40,056 --> 00:16:41,291
好
Okay.

297
00:16:41,291 --> 00:16:43,426
我只是想告诉你道理
Hey, I was just trying to make a point.

298
00:16:43,426 --> 00:16:46,796
你认为我当时应该打布克顿？
Yeah, so you think I should have fought with Coach Brockton today, huh?

299
00:16:46,796 --> 00:16:48,498
他羞辱你了
He slugged you, Dad.

300
00:16:48,498 --> 00:16:52,535
他打我所以我要回敬他？
Yeah, and because he slugged me, I guess I should've slugged him right back?

301
00:16:52,535 --> 00:16:55,741
无可否认，这也是符合逻辑的
You gotta admit, there's a certain logic to it.

302
00:16:56,439 --> 00:16:59,409
本，还记得这件事的起因吗？
Ben, do you remember how this whole thing got started?

303
00:16:59,409 --> 00:17:01,010
罗尼绊倒我
Rodney tripped me.

304
00:17:01,010 --> 00:17:03,847
罗尼绊倒你，所以我去跟教练谈判
Rodney tripped you, and that's why I went down to talk to the coach...

305
00:17:03,847 --> 00:17:06,182
接着我和他打起来
and we ended up punching each other up.

306
00:17:06,182 --> 00:17:07,917
这样问题解决了吗？
Now did that solve anything?

307
00:17:07,917 --> 00:17:10,258
不，但是痛快
No, but it was fun to watch.

308
00:17:11,421 --> 00:17:13,857
对，因为我和教练打架
Yeah, and because I fought with the coach...

309
00:17:13,857 --> 00:17:16,659
第二天你和罗尼又打了
the very next day, you and Rodney slug it out.

310
00:17:16,659 --> 00:17:18,628
解决问题了吗？
Did that solve anything?

311
00:17:18,628 --> 00:17:20,930
没有，所以我们今天又去了一趟
No, that's why we went down there today.

312
00:17:20,930 --> 00:17:23,700
对，若是我还手.
Okay, so suppose I had punched him back...

313
00:17:23,700 --> 00:17:25,635
能解决问题吗？
would that have solved anything?

314
00:17:25,635 --> 00:17:29,205
能，若你打断他的双手双脚.
Yeah, because he would have had two broken arms, two broken legs...

315
00:17:29,205 --> 00:17:32,108
打肿他的脸，他就当不了教练了
a fat lip, and he wouldn't be coaching anymore.

316
00:17:32,108 --> 00:17:34,944
对，当不成教练了
No, he wouldn't be coaching anymore...

317
00:17:34,944 --> 00:17:37,814
但他会坐上电动轮椅.
but he'd go out and he'd get one of those electric wheelchairs...

318
00:17:37,814 --> 00:17:41,656
拿着枪来到咱家门口
and he'd show up on our front lawn with a shotgun.

319
00:17:42,886 --> 00:17:45,727
我们可以以牙还牙
Two can play at that game, Dad.

320
00:17:45,755 --> 00:17:49,058
本，我们没有电动轮椅
Ben, we don't have an electric wheelchair.

321
00:17:49,058 --> 00:17:51,861
但我们可以弄来机关枪
No, but we could get a machine gun...

322
00:17:51,861 --> 00:17:55,134
像兰波一样干掉布克顿教练
and blow Mr. Brockton away, like in Rambo.

323
00:17:55,365 --> 00:17:58,701
好吧，就算这样.
Okay, all right, all right. Let's say we do that.

324
00:17:58,701 --> 00:18:00,570
咱胜利了!
All right, we won!

325
00:18:00,570 --> 00:18:02,272
你以为胜利了.
You think you've won...

326
00:18:02,272 --> 00:18:04,974
回到家，洗个澡.
and then you're back at home, and you're taking a shower...

327
00:18:04,974 --> 00:18:08,577
准备上床睡觉，就在此时.
and you're getting ready for bed, and suddenly along comes...

328
00:18:09,412 --> 00:18:10,814
布克顿太太来了
Mrs. Brockton.

329
00:18:10,814 --> 00:18:12,816
冲进浴室？
Into our shower?

330
00:18:12,816 --> 00:18:14,250
冲进客厅
No, into our living room...

331
00:18:14,250 --> 00:18:16,519
她也有机枪
and she brings her own machine gun...

332
00:18:16,519 --> 00:18:20,588
她干掉妈妈和凯罗
and she wipes out Mom and Carol.

333
00:18:21,157 --> 00:18:23,360
那咱怎么办？
And then what do we do?

334
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:27,167
首先，我们得自己做饭吃了
Well, for one thing, we cook for ourselves and...

335
00:18:28,331 --> 00:18:31,234
本，你怎么讨回公道？
Come on, Ben, don't you want to get even?

336
00:18:31,234 --> 00:18:33,670
有了，把汽车卖了，买辆坦克
Yeah, we trade in the Volvo and get a tank.

337
00:18:33,670 --> 00:18:37,874
对，好主意，咱跳上坦克
Yeah, that's good. Good, Ben, and then I hop into that tank...

338
00:18:37,874 --> 00:18:40,810
把布克顿家夷为平地
and I motor over to the Brocktons, and I blow them all away.

339
00:18:40,810 --> 00:18:42,178
棒极了!
All right!

340
00:18:42,178 --> 00:18:46,121
且慢，他们家草坪上有地雷
But wait, Ben, they booby-trapped the front lawn.

341
00:18:46,182 --> 00:18:48,623
那就太遗憾了
I'm sorry to hear that, Dad.

342
00:18:49,586 --> 00:18:51,387
我们撤退时.
So just as I'm pulling away...

343
00:18:51,387 --> 00:18:55,558
我和坦克都被炸飞了
that tank and your father get blown to Connecticut.

344
00:18:56,259 --> 00:18:58,666
天哪
Oh, my gosh.

345
00:18:59,863 --> 00:19:01,831
现在懂我意思了吗？
So you see what I'm getting at.

346
00:19:01,831 --> 00:19:04,999
对，只剩下我和麦克了
Yeah, I've been left alone with Mike.

347
00:19:06,069 --> 00:19:08,471
不，在你刷牙时.
No, because while you were brushing your teeth...

348
00:19:08,471 --> 00:19:11,708
罗尼的表哥把麦克解决了
Rodney's cousins came and took care of Mike.

349
00:19:13,076 --> 00:19:17,553
麦克也倒下了？剩下我一个？
They got Mike, too. So I'm all alone?

350
00:19:19,148 --> 00:19:20,750
出人意料对吧？
Weird, isn't it?

351
00:19:20,750 --> 00:19:25,830
几天前还有家庭，房子，汽车
Just a few days ago you had a family, a house, a Volvo.

352
00:19:25,922 --> 00:19:29,993
现在只剩下淡淡的回忆.
Now all you've got left are your subscriptions to Boys' Life magazine...

353
00:19:29,993 --> 00:19:32,432
还有前几天订的杂志
and a few faded memories.

354
00:19:33,496 --> 00:19:37,000
值得吗？我们没有做胆小鬼
But, hey, it was worth it, wasn't it? 'Cause we didn't chicken out.

355
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:39,644
我们还手了
No, sir, we fought back.

356
00:19:40,169 --> 00:19:42,205
还记得起因吗？
You remember how this got started again?

357
00:19:42,205 --> 00:19:43,740
罗尼绊倒我了
Rodney tripped me.

358
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:48,352
是的，不过他已经死了
Yes, Rodney. Well, we won't have him to worry about anymore.

359
00:19:49,012 --> 00:19:52,282
这问题也解决了
Guess we found a pretty good way to solve your problem.

360
00:19:52,282 --> 00:19:55,654
不，这个解决办法不好
No, we didn't, Dad. It was a stupid way.

361
00:19:56,386 --> 00:19:59,053
我还要喝一杯，你呢？
I need another drink. Want one?

362
00:19:59,155 --> 00:20:01,526
好吧，倒
Sure, set 'em up.

363
00:20:02,191 --> 00:20:05,562
你今天不是真的窝囊
So I guess you really didn't chicken out today, huh?

364
00:20:05,562 --> 00:20:08,501
我没有窝囊
No, I didn't chicken out, Ben.

365
00:20:08,765 --> 00:20:13,136
我只是认为暴力不能解决问题
I just feel that most of the time, fighting is not the answer...

366
00:20:13,136 --> 00:20:17,747
所以有可能的话，尽量尝试别的办法
and that, whenever possible, we really must try to find a better way.

367
00:20:18,408 --> 00:20:20,846
敬你这句话
I'll drink to that.

368
00:20:23,379 --> 00:20:25,114
爸爸？
You know what, Dad?

369
00:20:25,114 --> 00:20:26,583
什么事？
What, Ben?

370
00:20:26,583 --> 00:20:30,227
你没被炸飞就太好了
I'm glad you didn't get blown to Connecticut.

371
00:20:30,520 --> 00:20:32,492
我同意
So am I.

372
00:20:34,924 --> 00:20:36,059
爷儿俩，怎样了？
How you doing, guys?

373
00:20:36,059 --> 00:20:38,133
还好
Pretty good, Mom.

374
00:20:38,194 --> 00:20:40,797
一定是珍妮了
Ah, that must be Jennifer.

375
00:20:40,797 --> 00:20:45,806
可怜的女孩，还不知道 今晚麦克要对她的脚趾施暴
Poor girl, she has no idea what Mike's gonna do to her feet tonight.

376
00:20:48,004 --> 00:20:50,139
珍妮，真漂亮
Jennifer, what a neat dress.

377
00:20:50,139 --> 00:20:51,674
-进来吧 -谢谢
- Come on in. - Thanks.

378
00:20:51,674 --> 00:20:55,352
天哪，露脚趾的鞋子!
Oh, my God. Open-toed shoes!

379
00:20:55,712 --> 00:20:57,547
什么？
Pardon?

380
00:20:57,547 --> 00:20:59,315
没什么
Never mind.

381
00:20:59,315 --> 00:21:02,218
-珍妮，你真漂亮 -很漂亮
- Hi, Jennifer. Don't you look pretty. - Very nice.

382
00:21:02,218 --> 00:21:04,622
来笑一笑
Let me take a picture.

383
00:21:05,254 --> 00:21:07,295
珍妮
Jennifer.

384
00:21:11,728 --> 00:21:14,497
麦克，真帅
Mike, you look so handsome.

385
00:21:14,497 --> 00:21:18,107
就像酒家的服务员
Yeah, just like that waiter at the fish restaurant.

386
00:21:19,335 --> 00:21:23,104
麦克，我有坏消息，婚礼取消了
Mike, I got terrible news. The wedding's off.

387
00:21:23,906 --> 00:21:25,341
什么？
What?

388
00:21:25,341 --> 00:21:28,411
我姐发现新郎和伴娘鬼混
My sister caught the groom in the confessional with her maid of honor.

389
00:21:28,411 --> 00:21:30,880
她什么都说了
She broke the whole thing off.

390
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:32,548
我的功夫白费了？
After all I've been through?

391
00:21:32,548 --> 00:21:34,784
她怎能这样对我？
How could she do this to me?

392
00:21:34,784 --> 00:21:37,790
他确实多愁善感
We call him Mr. Sensitivity.

393
00:21:37,820 --> 00:21:39,255
珍妮，我们要补救补救
Jennifer, we can't let this happen.

394
00:21:39,255 --> 00:21:41,724
打个电话给你姐姐
I want you to go over here and call your sister right now...

395
00:21:41,724 --> 00:21:44,527
好让她别断送美好的人生
and talk some sense into that girl before she throws her life away.

396
00:21:44,527 --> 00:21:46,596
麦克，没用的，她们完了
Mike, it's no use. It's all over.

397
00:21:46,596 --> 00:21:48,164
打个电话嘛
I'm just asking you to call her.

398
00:21:48,164 --> 00:21:50,566
不行
I can't do that.

399
00:21:50,833 --> 00:21:53,110
麦克
说不定可以嫁给别人呢
Hey, maybe she could marry somebody else.

400
00:21:53,178 --> 00:21:54,279
好吧，过来
Mike!

401
00:21:54,279 --> 00:21:56,770
什么？
Okay, okay, fine. Okay, come here.

402
00:21:57,316 --> 00:21:58,383
过来吧
What?

403
00:21:58,383 --> 00:21:59,907
Just come here.

404
00:22:01,010 --> 00:22:04,618
我实在没心思跳舞
Mike, I'm really not in the mood for this.

405
00:22:07,283 --> 00:22:10,186
请把电话给我
Somebody give me the phone.

406
00:22:12,522 --> 00:22:16,324
麦姬，咱家出了个小魔王了
Maggie, I think we might have created a monster.

407
00:22:26,302 --> 00:22:27,637
本，球打得很好
You're looking good out there, Ben.

408
00:22:27,637 --> 00:22:31,608
布克顿教练离职后，我获得了重生
I feel like a new man since Coach Brockton got the boot.

409
00:22:31,974 --> 00:22:36,948
新教练来了，他跟球迷聊了很久了
Uh-oh, here comes the coach. It's five laps for talking with the fans.

410
00:22:47,590 --> 00:22:49,900
看我的!
Show off!

411
00:22:50,493 --> 00:22:53,229
好吧，大家过来
All right, come on, you guys. Let's get together here.

412
00:22:53,229 --> 00:22:54,564
明天第一场比赛!
First game's tomorrow. Let's go.

413
00:22:54,564 --> 00:22:58,238
打球应该怎样？
-我们该怎样？ -努力训练!
- What are we gonna do? - Try hard!

414
00:22:58,310 --> 00:22:59,511
要有体育精神!
And how are we gonna play?

415
00:22:59,511 --> 00:23:01,780
-若是输了呢？ -你会杀死我们!
In a sportsmanlike manner!

416
00:23:01,780 --> 00:23:04,340
是吗？
- And what if we don't win? - You'll kill us!

417
00:23:04,416 --> 00:23:05,484
说笑的!
How do I mean that?

418
00:23:05,484 --> 00:23:06,883
Facetiously!

419
00:23:52,864 --> 00:23:55,458
[zeroxia@gmail.com] 2006.04.01
